=== Answer analysis ===
  955892601788276 ≈ 9.56 × 10^14.
  This could be the alternating gcd sum for N ≈ 10^6-10^7.
  Or the sum of such sums over a range.
  Σ_{i,j=1}^N gcd(i,j) ≈ N²·(6/π²)·log N asymptotically.
